== 3. CT24: share = elasticity needs a price-free constraint set; with a BINDING ruin constraint it fails (Lemma B9 setting)
  B=0.5 (binding): shares read 0.5279 error 0.4721; elasticities c 0.5837 w 0.5632; sum of elasticities 1.1469
  B=5.0 (slack): shares read 0.5000 error 0.5000; elasticities c 0.5000 w 0.5000; sum of elasticities 1.0000
  so the ruin constraint's feasible set depends on the prices (the reserve pays J) and on income y and buffer B: Euler runs over (c, w, y, B) jointly when it binds.

